// plague_city's LastRites — Priest's burial rite. AbilityId 3.
// We use the EffectOp::Damage path purely as a delivery channel —
// the priest doesn't actually damage anyone, the consumer
// (ApplyLastRites @phase(post)) just clears the infected flag on
// the dead body when it sees the chronicle record arrive.
//
// `target: enemy` because the dispatcher's `hostile_only` gate would
// otherwise filter against the priest's team; the body-side check
// in PriestRites picks dead Citizen slots regardless.
//
// Lowers to AbilityProgram { gate: { cooldown_ticks: 0,
//                                    hostile_only: true },
//                            area: SingleTarget { range: 3.5 },
//                            effects: [EffectOp::Damage { amount: 0.0 }] }.

ability LastRites {
    target: enemy
    range: 3.5
    cooldown: 0

    damage 0 [PHYSICAL: 100]
}
